  "limitations": [
    "The Golem Press slice provides original five-member Salis formation, all four wooden Basic factory designs, strict completed research, physical components, fifth-tick Machina, menu/C2S and original renderer. It does not yet implement placer deployment, golem AI/task scheduling, controls/seals, bell pickup, combat, rank XP or advanced part/material research.",
    "Current 6-scene GolemPress client prepares predecessor research, 32+32 theory, physical component inventories and 12-unit Machina source as explicit fixtures. Mind completion, Salis formation, C2S component debit, fifth-tick typed consumption, one original props output and extraction are actual operations; no output golem is supplied. Manufacture and its extracted item do not establish functioning entity placement or seal tasks.",
    "Current 25-scene EssentiaProduction regression prepares predecessor research and MINDCLOCKWORK stage 2, typed sources/arcane ingredients/aura explicitly. Mind and Brain Box are actually crafted through C2S and the paid Brain Box is actually placed before capacity3 is checked. Its Mind stage 2 page is a fixture with unpaid requirements, not a global partial-stage cap; full original Mind progression is now implemented separately. It verifies real production, Salis/menu/catalyst/program selection, typed consumption, output/rendering and read-only book behavior.",
    "All 21 original focus node types execute, with branching and Advanced/Greater manufacturing; world Flux Rift and full taint/warp/world entity mechanics remain separate unfinished work. Current Auromancy client evidence is historical 0.19; its server tests are included in 645.",
    "Infusion research paths available 11/56; 45 preserve unimplemented late research gates. Available research paths do not establish a complete manual survival campaign or every original world ingredient source; Advanced/Greater Firebat/Pech/Primordial Pearl world acquisition remains incomplete.",
    "Cloud block cooldown uses wall-clock release timing; released living-target key mismatch and other audited BETA26 quirks are retained, with documented bounded/dimension/lifecycle hardening. Original press props0 animation and blocked final-output zero-cost stall are also retained.",
    "Models and media are audited original assets; native impact/vent particles, modern rendering APIs, bounded transaction guards and ore dictionary-to-tag matching are explicit adaptations rather than complete original FX/API parity.",
    "Centrifuge and Thaumatorium operate with actual ingredients, research, transport, paid completion and inventory output. Clockwork mind acquisition and full MINDCLOCKWORK progression are available; remaining Golemancy materials, autonomous AI, control seals and ESSENTIATRANSPORT are separate unfinished work.",
    "No independent-client multiplayer or full manual survival campaign is established by these checks."
  ],
